OL,3,  V-,,%-,,%-,,%S#"!##!###!##!
OL,5, A member of the ANC has been seriously
OL,6, injured in a car bomb explosion in
OL,7, Maputo, the capital of Mozambique.
OL,9,FMr Albie Saks, a prominent white South
OL,10,FAfrican lawyer, has been in exile in
OL,11,FMozambique since 1975.
OL,12,F
OL,13,FMr Saks was injured when his car blew
OL,14,Fup in a suburb of the city. The
OL,15,Fexplosion broke windows of houses
OL,16,Fnearby.
OL,18,FLast week, the ANC's representative in
OL,19,FFrance was shot dead outside the
OL,20,Forganisation's Paris office.
OL,21,F
OL,23,T]Cfrom 07-04-88 / teletextarchive.com
OL,24,ANext PageBT'text FilesCRewindFReg Radio
